# Local storage. bridge/storage.js writes one file per key when running on the
# PC; production uses Netlify Blobs.
#
# TRACKED DATA — never delete these, they are not scratch:
#   bridge/package.json, bridge/seed-recipes.json,
#   bridge/schedule-classes.json, bridge/snacks.json
# Clean local storage with the named list below, never `rm bridge/*.json`.
